WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
1. Waiter takes the order on a phone.

00:08.000 --> 00:18.000
2. Kitchen sees it at once, with a sound alert.

00:18.000 --> 00:28.000
3. Waiter serves when it is ready.

00:28.000 --> 00:42.000
4. Cashier takes payment and gives the receipt.

00:42.000 --> 01:00.000
5. Owner sees today's sales.
